        <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">Add 2 to armour saving throws made for the bearer.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Enhanced Bionics" id="0062-f25f-8e63-5840" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a model in this unit would lose a wound, roll one D6: on a 5+, that wound is not lost.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Master-crafted Bionics" id="b9e7-6d72-ae76-cdcd" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a model in this unit would lose a wound, roll one D6: on a 5+, that wound is not lost.
Each comand phase, models with this ability regain 1 wound.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Airborne" id="0593-0ccb-413a-352e" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">This model cannot charge, can only be charged by units that can FLY, and can only attack or be attacked in the Fight phase by units that can FLY.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
      <modifiers>
        <modifier field="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" type="set" value="Each time you declare a charge with this model, you can only select AIRCRAFT units as the target(s) of that charge. This model can only be chosen as a target of a charge if the unit making the charge can FLY. You can only fight with this model if it is within engagement Range of any enemy units that can FLY, and this model can only make melee attacks against units that can FLY. Enemy units can only make melee attacks against this model if they can FLY.">
          <comment>Each time you declare a charge with this model, you can only select AIRCRAFT units as the target(s) of that charge. This model can only be chosen as a target of a charge if the unit making the charge can FLY. You can only fight with this model if it is within engagement Range of any enemy units that can FLY, and this model can only make melee attacks against units that can FLY. Enemy units can only make melee attacks against this model if they can FLY.</comment>
          <conditionGroups>
            <conditionGroup type="or">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="7468-bb7b-3ad0-2c43" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="ancestor" shared="true" type="instanceOf" value="1"/>
                <condition childId="7468-bb7b-3ad0-2c43" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="instanceOf" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </conditionGroup>
          </conditionGroups>
        </modifier>
      </modifiers>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Hard to hit" id="236e-8f8f-bc13-7537" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a ranged attack is made against this unit, a hit roll of 1-3 for that attack fails. Substract 1 from that attack&apos;s hit roll.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Supersonic" id="9287-7a45-71ff-3a46" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time this model moves, first pivot it on the spot up to 120° (this does not contribute to how far the model moves) and then move the model straight forwards. It cannot pivot again after the initial pivot. 
When this model Advances, instead of rolling a dice, increase its Move characteristic by 20&quot; until the end of the phase.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Hover Jet" id="8170-e49b-25ed-eff6" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When deploying the unit and before this model moves in your Movement phase, you can declare it will Hover. 
Its Move characteristic becomes 20&quot;, and it loses the Hard to Hit and Supersonic abilities until the beginning of your next Movement phase.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
      <modifiers>
        <modifier field="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" type="set" value="When deploying the unit and before this model moves in your Movement phase, you can declare it will Hover. Its Move characteristic becomes 20&quot;, and it loses the Hard to Hit and Supersonic abilities until the beginning of your next Movement phase, and allows the unit to make Charge moves against units without AIRCRAFT Keyword.">
          <comment>When deploying the unit and before this model moves in your Movement phase, you can declare it will Hover. 
Its Move characteristic becomes 20&quot;, and it loses the Hard to Hit and Supersonic abilities until the beginning of your next Movement phase, and allows the unit to make Charge moves against units without AIRCRAFT Keyword.</comment>
          <conditionGroups>
            <conditionGroup type="or">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="7468-bb7b-3ad0-2c43" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="ancestor" shared="true" type="instanceOf" value="1"/>
                <condition childId="7468-bb7b-3ad0-2c43" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="instanceOf" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </conditionGroup>
          </conditionGroups>
        </modifier>
      </modifiers>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Infiltrator" id="e5f0-f07d-da24-96b0" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">During deployment, this unit can be set up anywhere on the battlefield that is not within 9&quot; your opponent&apos;s deployment zone and is more than 12&quot; from any enemy unit.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Grav-Blaster" id="9802-3c7a-576e-2f13" hidden="false" typeId="d5f97c0b-9fc9-478d-aa34-a7c414d3ea48" typeName="Weapon">
