    </profile>
    <profile name="Death from Above" id="2a93-0488-0277-cb07" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- During deployment, if every model in this unit has this ability, then you can set up this unit high in the skies instead of setting it up on the battlefield.
- If you do, then in the Reinforcements step of one of your Movement phases you can set up this unit anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 6+D3&quot; away from enemy models.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Smoke grenade" id="eee2-68d1-b457-bb08" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Once per phase, when an attack is declared to a unit with a model with this ability, it can use a Smoke grenade. If doing so, during the remain of that phase, attacks made against that unit will suffer a -1 to hit rolls penalty. 
- Each Smoke grenade can be used once per battle.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Concussion grenade" id="7c76-6871-8cbd-49c6" hidden="false" typeId="d5f97c0b-9fc9-478d-aa34-a7c414d3ea48" typeName="Weapon">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="6fa97fa8-ea74-4a27-a0fb-bc4e5f367464">12&quot;</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Type" typeId="077c342f-d7b9-45c6-b8af-88e97cafd3a2">Grenade D6</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="S" typeId="59b1-319e-ec13-d466">5</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="AP" typeId="75aa-a838-b675-6484">0</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="D" typeId="ae8a-3137-d65b-4ca7">0</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">CAVALRY, BIKER, INFANTRY, BEAST or SWARM units which this weapon manages to wound will, until the next Command phase, get their charge rolls halved (rounding up), and cannot fire Overwatch. 
Each Concussion grenade can be used once per battle.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Melta Demolition charge" id="a9c7-420d-40c5-1f4d" hidden="false" typeId="d5f97c0b-9fc9-478d-aa34-a7c414d3ea48" typeName="Weapon">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="6fa97fa8-ea74-4a27-a0fb-bc4e5f367464">Bomb (1&quot;)</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Type" typeId="077c342f-d7b9-45c6-b8af-88e97cafd3a2">Heavy 1</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="S" typeId="59b1-319e-ec13-d466">8</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="AP" typeId="75aa-a838-b675-6484">-4</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="D" typeId="ae8a-3137-d65b-4ca7">D6+4</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">Each time a successful wound roll is made for an attack with this weapon, the target suffers 3 mortal wounds in addition to any other damage. 
Each Melta Demolition Charge can be used once per battle.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
