      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Volkite Carronade" id="257e-0d33-993e-a91d" hidden="false" typeId="d5f97c0b-9fc9-478d-aa34-a7c414d3ea48" typeName="Weapon">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="6fa97fa8-ea74-4a27-a0fb-bc4e5f367464">72&quot;</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Type" typeId="077c342f-d7b9-45c6-b8af-88e97cafd3a2">Heavy 2D3</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="S" typeId="59b1-319e-ec13-d466">14</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="AP" typeId="75aa-a838-b675-6484">-4</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="D" typeId="ae8a-3137-d65b-4ca7">6</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">Each time an attack is made with this weapon, an unmodified wound roll of 6 inflicts 3 mortal wounds on the target in addition to any normal damage.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="[Action] Void Shield Recharge" id="723a-3186-0153-98ca" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Instead of moving, during your Movement phase a unit with this system can begin to recharge one of it&apos;s Void Shield Layers.
- This action is completed at the beggining of the next own command phase, and is not interrupted by shooting or fighting, but while the unit doing the action, cannot pile in or consolidate.
- If doing so, it must regain a collapsed Void Shield Layer first.
- When recharging a Void Shield Layer, it will regain all of its wounds.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Void Shield" id="2704-7cf7-6d89-c451" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Whilst a Void Shield Layer is active, the bearer has an 5+ invulnerable save.
- Void Shield Layers have a Toughness and Save characteristic equal to the Void Shield bearer model.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Impervious to small weapons fire" id="b48e-9a4a-2fdc-5d7c" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time an attack of Strength 5 or less is allocated to a model in this unit, add 1 to the armour Saving throws.
- In addition, re-roll failed armour Saving throws of 1 from attacks of Strength 5 or less.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Concealed Positions" id="a6dc-059d-a47a-a49c" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <comment>a6dc-059d-a47a-a49c</comment>
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">During Deployment when you set up this unit, if every model in this unit has this ability then it can be set up anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 9&quot; away from the enemy deployment zone and any enemy models.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Additional armour plating" id="5b3f-8e7c-f7ae-0f7c" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time an attack of Strength 6 or less is allocated to a model in this unit, add 1 to the armour Saving throws.
- In addition, re-roll failed armour Saving throws of 1 from attacks of Strength 6 or less.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
