        <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
        <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
      </costs>
      <rules>
        <rule name=" Multi-Purpose Reactive Armour packcage" id="c1dd-ca30-8f4b-c095" hidden="false">
          <description>When a model equiped with this system make a charge movement, can use a Multi-Purpose Reactive Armour packcage.
When doing so, after the charge movement, but before any pile-in or consolidation movements, roll a D6 for each CAVALRY, BIKER, INFANTRY, BEAST or SWARM miniature at 3&quot; of the model. On a 5+, the model&apos;s unit suffers a mortal wound.
Each Multi-Purpose Reactive Armour packcage can be used once per battle.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </selectionEntry>
