        <profile name="Teleport homer" id="00c3-bb84-ba49-047a" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per battle, at the start of your Movement phase, you can remove the bearer&apos;s unit from the battlefield, and during the Reinforcements step, you can set this unit back up either anywhere on the battlefield more than D3+6&quot; away from any enemy models, or anywhere within 3&quot; of a friendly &lt;CHAPTER&gt; model, outside engagement range of enemy units. 
If the battle ends and this unit is not on the battlefield it is considered to be destroyed.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
