                  </modifiers>
                  <profiles>
                    <profile name="Tech Scavengers" id="1bf6-9941-ad41-2d8d" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the end of a Battle, if an ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit from your Army has destroyed the VEHICLE with highest Power Rating of your opponent&apos;s army, that ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit gains 3 experience points and this mision is achieved.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry name="Omnissiah&apos;s Will (+1RP)" id="36d0-6017-58b2-fe3d" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="1"/>
                  </costs>
                  <modifiers>
                    <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
                      <conditionGroups>
                        <conditionGroup type="and">
                          <conditions>
                            <condition childId="55e9-6c64-47ec-1a71" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="6030-15c5-bda1-858c" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0"/>
                          </conditions>
                        </conditionGroup>
                      </conditionGroups>
                    </modifier>
                  </modifiers>
                  <profiles>
                    <profile name="Omnissiah&apos;s Will" id="ef5e-8198-c783-267e" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Before the battle, select a Canticle of the Omnissiah. 
At the end of a Battle, if at least 3 enemy units were destroyed by an ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit from your Army while that Canticle was active, this mision is achieved. 
ADEPTUS MECHANICUS units also receive 1 experience point for each enemy unit it destroyed with the Canticle being active.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry name="Fight for the Future (+1RP)" id="f9e8-4e54-237d-2a5b" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="1"/>
                  </costs>
                  <modifiers>
                    <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
                      <conditionGroups>
                        <conditionGroup type="and">
                          <conditions>
                            <condition childId="a6e9-7968-4980-dcfa" childName="Aeldari mix (all missions)" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="6030-15c5-bda1-858c" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0"/>
                            <condition childId="bafc-494f-4fce-550f" childName="Aeldari Craftworlds" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="6030-15c5-bda1-858c" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0"/>
                          </conditions>
                        </conditionGroup>
                      </conditionGroups>
                    </modifier>
                  </modifiers>
                  <profiles>
                    <profile name="Fight for the Future" id="eeab-c550-69ca-ca97" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Keep a Fight for the Future tally for each AELDARI unit from your army. Each time an AELDARI unit destroys an enemy unit, add 1 to that AELDARI unit’s Fight for the Future tally. If that unit was a SLAANESH unit, add 2 to that AELDARI unit’s tally instead.

At the end of the battle, each unit that has any marks on its Fight for the Future tally gains 1 experience point. If that unit has 3 or more marks, it gains 3 experience points instead.

If any AELDARI unit from your Army gains at least 1 point in the tally, this mision is achieved.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry name="A perfect rehearsal (+1RP)" id="175b-2ed4-37e0-5983" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="1"/>
                  </costs>
                  <modifiers>
                    <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
                      <conditionGroups>
                        <conditionGroup type="and">
                          <conditions>
                            <condition childId="a6e9-7968-4980-dcfa" childName="Aeldari mix (all missions)" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="6030-15c5-bda1-858c" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0"/>
                          </conditions>
                        </conditionGroup>
                      </conditionGroups>
                    </modifier>
                  </modifiers>
                  <profiles>
                    <profile name="A perfect rehearsal" id="23c6-d336-c0f3-74d0" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of a Battle, identify which three models in your opponent’s army have the highest Power Rating (excluding AIRCRAFT models). 
These models are performance targets. If any models are tied, you can select which of those will be performance targets.
At the end of the battle, if all three performance targets have been destroyed by your Army, all RILIETANN units from your army gain 3 experience points and this mision is achieved.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry name="Souls for strength (+1RP)" id="5e01-17b6-51cf-fbb0" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
