Each time a HERETEK CULT unit from your army captures one of these objective markers during the Movement phase, it can attempt to make a Claim prize [Action], that is completed at the end of your turn. If that action is completed, you can remove that objective marker, and the unit that have done the action, gains 1 experience point.
