                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of the battle, your opponent selects five different units from their army, (if your opponent&apos;s army has less than five units, they select as many as possible).
If a target unit splits into multiple, smaller units, then all of those units must be destroyed for that target unit to be considered destroyed.
At the end of the battle, if all targets have been destroyed, this mission is acomplised. 
Each time a target is destroyed by an attack made by a BIOFORM model from your army, that BIOFORM model’s unit gains 2 experience points.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                </selectionEntry>
