                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the end of the battle, if at least one enemy CHARACTER, VEHICLE or MONSTER unit have been destroyed by an ORK CHARACTER from your army, this mission is acomplished.
At the end of the battle, for each time an ORK CHARACTER from your army destroys an enemy CHARACTER, VEHICLE or MONSTER unit, that ORK CHARACTER gains 1 experience point.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                </selectionEntry>
