                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of the battle, identify which 3 models in your opponent’s army have the highest Wounds characteristics (if any units are tied, you can select which of those will be a target). 
At the end of the battle, if all 3 targets have been destroyed, this mission is acomplised. 
Each time a target is destroyed by an attack made by a ORK model from your army from an unit without CHARACTER Keyword, that ORK model’s unit gains 2 experience points.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                </selectionEntry>
