                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Purchase this Requisition when an ASPECT WARRIOR unit from your Army with an EXARCH model in it gains a rank.
That unit obtains one Exarch Power it don&apos;t knows. A unit can only have one Exarch Power.
You cannot purchase this Requisition if doing so would cause your total PL to exceed your Army&apos;s Supply Limit.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                </selectionEntry>
