                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Purchase this Requisition when an ARCHON, SUCCUBUS or HAEMONCULUS unit from your Army gains the Veteran, Heroic or Legendary rank.
That model is upgraded to a Lord of Commoragh; increase its PL accordingly.
You cannot purchase this Requisition if doing so would cause your total PL to exceed your Army&apos;s Supply Limit.</characteristic>
