                            <characteristic name="D" typeId="ae8a-3137-d65b-4ca7">-</characteristic>
                            <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">When resolving an attack with this weapon against a unit without INORGANIC, VEHICLE or TITANIC Keywords, if a hit is scored, do not make a wound roll: instead roll 2D6; if the result is equal to or greater than the target unit’s highest Leadership characteristic, it suffers 3 mortal wounds.</characteristic>
