                                  <characteristics>
                                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">During your Charge phase, select a ORDO XENOS CORE unit within 6&quot; of this WARLORD. Until the end of the next Fighting phase, models in that unit add 1 to their Attacks characteristic. Add 1D3 Attacks if the CORE unit has the MONSTER or VEHICLE Keywords.</characteristic>
