                                  <characteristics>
                                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly ORDO XENOS CORE unit is within 6&quot; of this WARLORD, you can re-roll Morale test taken for that unit.
In your Command phase, you can select a ORDO XENOS CORE unit within 9&quot; of this WARLORD. Until your next Command phase that unit can make an action and shoot during the Shooting phase without failing that action.</characteristic>
                                  </characteristics>
                                </profile>
                              </profiles>
                            </selectionEntry>
                            <selectionEntry name="2. Death in Fire" id="32af-51f6-ff80-49e3" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
