                                  <characteristics>
                                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a ORDO HERETICUS CORE unit within 6&quot; of this WARLORD selects an objective for attacks with a Flame weapon that makes a random number of attacks, do not roll the number of attacks. The weapon makes the maximum number of attacks possible.</characteristic>
